#ASSERT `Who may appoint a new trustee in place of mine` `has been out of Victoria` (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 2 3 2027) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no one under section 41 (the Court may appoint under section 48)`
