-- s 51(2)(i) (regulative). Written request 1 March 2027: the 28 days end 29 March 2027. Arguments: absolutely entitled,
-- request, acted, day acted, today.
#ASSERT `Has my trustee acted on my written request` TRUE (`d` 1 3 2027) TRUE (`d` 15 3 2027) (`d` 1 4 2027) EQUALS JUST `the trustee acted within the 28 days`
#ASSERT `Has my trustee acted on my written request` TRUE (`d` 1 3 2027) TRUE (`d` 29 3 2027) (`d` 1 4 2027) EQUALS JUST `the trustee acted within the 28 days`
#ASSERT `Has my trustee acted on my written request` TRUE (`d` 1 3 2027) TRUE (`d` 30 3 2027) (`d` 1 4 2027) EQUALS JUST `the trustee neglected for 28 days: the Court may make a vesting order`
#ASSERT `Has my trustee acted on my written request` TRUE (`d` 1 3 2027) FALSE (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 29 3 2027) EQUALS JUST `the 28 days are still running`
